# Tuning applied to IDENTITY=own.
#
# Appended to arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig right before the build generates
# its .config, so these are the last word on each symbol. NOT applied to `repro`,
# which has to stay an exact copy of the phone's kernel.
#
# Every symbol here is also what scripts/20-verify.sh is allowed to forgive, by
# construction: it reads this file and accepts exactly these symbols. A diff
# outside this list still fails the build.
#
# One entry per reason. If a knob cannot say why it is here, it does not belong.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Debug symbols are not built.
#
# CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO with DWARF4 is ~1 GB of vmlinux nobody ships. It does not
# change the Image at all - build time and artifact size only. This is the one
# change in this file that cannot affect how the phone runs, which is exactly
# why it survived the batch 1 failure.
#
# The two lines after it are not settings: they are the symbols that stop
# existing once DEBUG_INFO is off. They are listed so this file stays a complete
# record of what the build changes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO is not set
# CONFIG_GDB_SCRIPTS is not set
# CONFIG_DEBUG_EFI is not set

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REVERTED, do not add back: CONFIG_KASAN off.
#
# Reason: the build with KASAN off **hangs this phone at the POCO logo**, with no
# adb and no log. Proven by bisection - the same KernelSU-Next driver with the
# phone's original config boots fine, so the sanitizer removal was the cause.
# Image size difference confirms it: 35,873,484 bytes with KASAN, 35,805,516
# without, while DEBUG_INFO changes nothing in the Image.
#
# Whatever the theoretical cost of running KASAN on this hardware, an unbootable
# kernel costs more. If it is ever revisited, it needs a device-side log (serial
# or last_kmsg) to explain the hang first - not another flash.
#
#   # CONFIG_KASAN is not set
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
